---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy & Cookies — Ariadna Balsells" lang="en"
  description="Privacy and cookie policy for Ariadna Balsells, speech therapist in Woluwe-Saint-Lambert: how your data is handled, your rights and cookie preferences.">

  <section class="policy">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy & Cookies</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        This page explains how your personal data is handled when you use this site, which
        cookies are used, and how to manage your preferences.
      </p>

      <h2>Data controller</h2>
      <p>
        Ariadna Balsells, speech therapist — Place de la Sainte-Famille 23, 1200
        Woluwe-Saint-Lambert (Brussels). For any question about your data:
        <a class="text-link" href="mailto:ariadna.logopede@gmail.com">ariadna.logopede@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What data is processed?</h2>
      <p>
        This site contains no forms and does not directly collect any health data. Three
        situations may involve processing of personal data:
      </p>
      <ul class="privacy-list">
        <li><strong>Contact by email, phone or WhatsApp</strong> — your contact details and the
        content of your message are used solely to reply to you and follow up on your request.</li>
        <li><strong>Online booking</strong> — appointments are made on the external platform
        Cal.com, which processes your data under its own privacy policy.</li>
        <li><strong>Audience measurement</strong> — only with your consent, through the cookies
        described below.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict and object to the
        processing of your data. Simply send a request by email. You can also lodge a complaint
        with the Belgian Data Protection Authority
        (<a class="text-link" href="https://www.dataprotectionauthority.be" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">dataprotectionauthority.be</a>).
      </p>

      <h2>What is a cookie?</h2>
      <p>
        A cookie is a small file stored on your device when you visit a website. It can, for
        example, remember your preferences or measure site traffic. "Essential" cookies are
        necessary for the site to work properly; all others are only set with your consent.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies used on this site</h2>

      <div class="cookie-cat">
        <h3>Essential</h3>
        <p>
          A single essential cookie is used to remember your cookie choice
          (<code>cookie_consent</code>). It is kept for about 6 months and only serves to avoid
          asking you again on every visit. It does not require your consent.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cookie-cat">
        <h3>Audience measurement — Google Analytics</h3>
        <p>
          With your consent, Google Analytics is used to understand how visitors arrive at the
          site and which pages they view. This information is aggregated and helps improve the
          site. These cookies are only set if you accept them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cookie-cat">
        <h3>Form — Google Forms</h3>
        <p>
          The "Home consultation" page displays a request form provided by Google Forms.
          Until you accept cookies, the form stays hidden and a link lets you open it
          directly on Google. The answers you submit are used only to handle your
          appointment request and are never shared with third parties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cookie-cat">
        <h3>Map — Google Maps</h3>
        <p>
          The Contact page displays a map provided by Google Maps. Until you accept cookies, the
          map stays hidden and a link lets you open it directly on Google Maps. Once cookies are
          accepted, the map is shown on the page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Manage my preferences</h2>
      <p>
        You can change your choice at any time by reopening the consent window below. You can also
        delete cookies through your browser settings.
      </p>
      <button type="button" class="manage-btn" onclick="window.openCookieSettings && window.openCookieSettings()">
        Change my cookie preferences
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
  .policy { padding: 5rem 0 4rem; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .lead { color: var(--color-text-light); line-height: 1.75; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
  }
  h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text); }
  p { color: var(--color-text-light); line-height: 1.75; }
  code {
    background: var(--color-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.1em 0.4em; font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .privacy-list {
    list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1rem 0 0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.85rem;
  }
  .privacy-list li {
    color: var(--color-text-light); line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 1.25rem; position: relative;
  }
  .privacy-list li::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.6em;
    width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .privacy-list strong { color: var(--color-text); font-weight: 500; }
  .text-link { color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: underline; }
  .cookie-cat {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  .manage-btn {
    margin-top: 1rem; padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
    background: var(--color-accent); color: white; border: none;
    border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;
    font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .manage-btn:hover { background: var(--color-accent-dark); }
</style>
